    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/702400a8254c045faafc7f9a3259170b.poster.avif?t=1750279969\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/702400a8254c045faafc7f9a3259170b.webm?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/702400a8254c045faafc7f9a3259170b.mp4?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gather valuable resources, explore uncharted territories, and unlock even more opportunities for survival. Forests, mountains, and hidden caves hold not only threats but also materials <br>essential for crafting tools, building shelters, and ensuring your safety in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/044b75ce2944e6ea1120de052f257f94.poster.avif?t=1750279969\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/044b75ce2944e6ea1120de052f257f94.webm?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/044b75ce2944e6ea1120de052f257f94.mp4?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world filled with deadly dangers and limitless possibilities. Build shelters, gather resources, and find ways to survive using your skills and ingenuity. Every discovery becomes a step toward making this harsh world your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/972ab22a672dd6fd18b3540a8d374185.poster.avif?t=1750279969\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/972ab22a672dd6fd18b3540a8d374185.webm?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/972ab22a672dd6fd18b3540a8d374185.mp4?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become a true hunter in the wild: track your prey to secure food and valuable resources. From small game to larger predators, every hunt requires strategy and precision. Use the materials you gather to craft weapons, tools, and upgrade your equipment to improve your chances of survival.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/702400a8254c045faafc7f9a3259170b.poster.avif?t=1750279969\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/702400a8254c045faafc7f9a3259170b.webm?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/702400a8254c045faafc7f9a3259170b.mp4?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gather valuable resources, explore uncharted territories, and unlock even more opportunities for survival. Forests, mountains, and hidden caves hold not only threats but also materials <br>essential for crafting tools, building shelters, and ensuring your safety in the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/044b75ce2944e6ea1120de052f257f94.poster.avif?t=1750279969\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/044b75ce2944e6ea1120de052f257f94.webm?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/044b75ce2944e6ea1120de052f257f94.mp4?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world filled with deadly dangers and limitless possibilities. Build shelters, gather resources, and find ways to survive using your skills and ingenuity. Every discovery becomes a step toward making this harsh world your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/972ab22a672dd6fd18b3540a8d374185.poster.avif?t=1750279969\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/972ab22a672dd6fd18b3540a8d374185.webm?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425440/extras/972ab22a672dd6fd18b3540a8d374185.mp4?t=1750279969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become a true hunter in the wild: track your prey to secure food and valuable resources. From small game to larger predators, every hunt requires strategy and precision. Use the materials you gather to craft weapons, tools, and upgrade your equipment to improve your chances of survival.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a harsh open world where every choice can mean the difference between life and death. Explore untamed lands, build shelters, hunt, craft tools, and defend yourself from threats. Nature, weather, and unexpected events will test your will to survive.",
